  "description" : "<p>APEX Signature allows you to capture signatures and sign documents. Features include drawing, image upload, webcam capture, and document signing with PDF overlay.</p><p><b>Version 3.1.0 New Features:</b></p><ul><li>Document Signing: Upload PDF/image and place signatures</li><li>Drag-and-drop signature positioning</li><li>Resize signatures with handles</li><li>Multi-page PDF navigation</li><li>Multiple signatures per document</li><li>Typed signature with custom fonts</li><li>Export signed documents as PNG</li></ul><p><b>Version 3.0.0 Features:</b></p><ul><li>Multi-Input Capture: Draw, Upload, or Webcam modes</li><li>Tab interface for switching between capture modes</li><li>Universal Theme and Dark mode support</li></ul>",
